  canvasLabel: "Animated leaky integrate-and-fire neuron: input spikes drive a membrane-potential trace that leaks, charges, fires at the threshold, and resets by subtraction.",
  scopeNote: "Defaults from <code>spikeforge/neurons/contract.py</code> (<code>DEFAULT_BETA</code>, <code>DEFAULT_THRESHOLD</code>). Notation matches the dashboard’s <code>U[t]</code>/<code>I[t]</code>/<code>S[t]</code> traces.",
  featureEncoding: "Rate, latency, delta, and random spike coders.",
  featureTraining: "Fully connected and convolutional LIF networks with surrogate-gradient cross-entropy, live loss and accuracy, checkpointing, AMP, gradient checkpointing, truncated BPTT, and multi-GPU options.",
  featureTopologies: "<code>fc_legacy</code>, <code>fc_small</code>, <code>conv_net</code>, <code>recurrent_net</code>, and the <code>sequence_mlp</code> and <code>sequence_attn</code> presets.",
  featureDatasets: "MNIST, Fashion-MNIST, KMNIST, QMNIST, USPS, EMNIST, CIFAR-10, and—with the <code>events</code> extra—N-MNIST, DVS128 Gesture, CIFAR10-DVS, and Spiking Speech Commands.",
  featureInterpreter: "NIR export, an independent NIR interpreter, and numerical drift validation against it.",
  featureIntrospection: "Educational-mode <code>U[t]</code>/<code>I[t]</code>/<code>S[t]</code> traces, trajectory metrics, encoding and decoding reports, and surrogate-derivative curves.",
