  statusLearning: "On-chip / local learning rules", statusLearningNote: "Hebbian associative memory and pair-based STDP are available; reward-modulated and hardware-resident variants are not started.",
  statusVendorNote: "Backend probes are tested with each vendor SDK simulator and report unavailable when an SDK is missing. They have not run on physical hardware.",
  statusPypi: "PyPI release", statusPypiNote: "All seven distributions are on PyPI; <code>./install.sh</code> also remains available.",
